Phase 5.1 (LLM-CORE dual-generation plan): explicit state-root overrides for
opencode V1, in packages/core/src/global.ts.

Every existing default is preserved byte for byte: each variable only
replaces its value when it is set.

  app    = OPENCODE_APP_NAME   ?? "opencode"
  data   = OPENCODE_DATA_HOME  ?? path.join(xdgData!,  app)
  cache  = OPENCODE_CACHE_HOME ?? path.join(xdgCache!, app)
  state  = OPENCODE_STATE_HOME ?? path.join(xdgState!, app)
  config = Flag.OPENCODE_CONFIG_DIR ?? Path.config   (unchanged)

The concrete roots are per-machine and are supplied by the NixOS module's
`opencode` wrapper, not by this package.

